    num: "04",
    title: "Sustainable & Efficient Upgrades",
    desc: "Green building practices that lower your long-term operating costs. We use life cycle costing (LCC) to compare the full cost of each upgrade over its life, including purchase, running and maintenance. That way we choose the upgrades that save you the most over time."
  },
